From: ChatGPT Kernel project
Subject: [PATCH] mm: restore baseline reclaim watermark default

The wider TAPAS/A13 candidate keeps the base default instead of retaining
an unmeasured low-memory policy experiment. Runtime ROM policy remains
in control. This does not claim a performance improvement by itself.

---
 mm/page_alloc.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/mm/page_alloc.c b/mm/page_alloc.c
--- a/mm/page_alloc.c
+++ b/mm/page_alloc.c
@@ -435,7 +435,7 @@
 int min_free_kbytes = 1024;
 int user_min_free_kbytes = -1;
 int watermark_boost_factor __read_mostly = 15000;
-int watermark_scale_factor = 64;
+int watermark_scale_factor = 10;
 
 static unsigned long nr_kernel_pages __initdata;
 static unsigned long nr_all_pages __initdata;
